## Why This Is Asked
Tests data residency, cross-region replication, tenancy isolation, and data catalog lineage. Also checks governance, observability, and how to validate compliance.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant residency and isolation
- Region-aware replication and access control
- Glue Data Catalog and Athena partitioning
- OpenTelemetry tracing across services
- Audit, policy checks, and drift testing

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-routing: route by tenant residency
function route(event) {
  const tenant = event.tenant_id;
  const region = get_tregion(tenant);
  if (region === 'EU') {
    return `s3://eu-${tenant}-telemetry`;
  } else {
    return `s3://us-${tenant}-telemetry`;
  }
}
```

